## Playnite SDK

Playlist is a Playnite extension and is built against `PlayniteSDK`. The SDK is
provided at runtime by the Playnite host application and is not redistributed in
the `.pext` package. Upstream: https://github.com/JosefNemec/Playnite

## IcoFont

The following assets use glyphs from [IcoFont](https://icofont.com/):

- `icon.png` — extension icon (derived from the `play-alt-1` glyph)
- `play-alt-1.svg` — source glyph reference
- Sidebar back navigation control — `ui-play` glyph via Playnite's `FontIcoFont`

IcoFont icons are used under the
[Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)
(CC BY 4.0). IcoFont font files may additionally be subject to the SIL Open Font
License as stated by IcoFont.

Attribution: Icons by IcoFont — https://icofont.com

## HowLongToBeat plugin interoperability

Upstream project: https://github.com/Lacro59/playnite-howlongtobeat-plugin

License: MIT (scoped to interoperability sources in this repository only)

Playlist contains HowLongToBeat interoperability code under
`third_party/howlongtobeat/` (cache/settings consumption, progress bar UI,
add-on navigation, sorting, and related helpers). The MIT text in that folder's
`LICENSE` applies only to those files, not to the whole extension. See also:

- `third_party/howlongtobeat/LICENSE`
- `third_party/howlongtobeat/NOTICE.md`
